<section aria-labelledby="ways-h" class="sec" style="background:#ffffff; "><div class="wrap"><h2 id="ways-h" class="h2" style="color:#ED217C; margin-bottom:56px">Four ways <br>to give</h2>
<div class="rules"><div class="rule-row"><h3>Donate</h3><p>It costs, on average, £200 to rehome a cat. Donations help us to keep helping the cats that need us. Give once, or every month.</p><div class="act"><a class="btn btn-donate btn-sm" href="/donate/" >Donate</a></div></div><div class="rule-row"><h3>Foster</h3><p>Fostering is the vital stepping stone in our work. It gives our cats the chance to feel safe during what can be a very stressful time for them.</p><div class="act"><a class="link" href="/foster/">About fostering<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="rule-row"><h3>Fundraise</h3><p>As a registered charity we rely on fundraising and donations. If you fancy holding a fundraising event for us, we would be overjoyed. A cake sale, car boot sale, quiz night or coffee morning would all be wonderful.</p><div class="act"><a class="link" href="/contact/">Talk to us<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="rule-row"><h3>Wish list</h3><p>We are always in need of supplies, so we have set up a Wish List on Amazon. It is an easy way for our supporters to donate the products we really need.</p><div class="act"><a class="link" href="{{ site.wishlist or "#" }}"{% if not site.wishlist %} data-placeholder="link to add"{% else %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>Open our Wish List<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section>

